{"version":1,"content":"<p>已故賭王四房兒子、現年31歲的何猷君，與超模太太奚夢瑤婚後育有一對子女，一家四口生活幸福美滿。</p><p>成家後的何猷君事業心更重，全力專注於商界發展，不時北上出席各類大型活動。</p><p>日前，他便以「董事長」的身份，前往廣西賀州出席「2026年廣西文化旅遊發展</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:20.894248+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:01:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:41.715900+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:41.715900+00:00","content_hash":"742547c7f849dcaeddd2d4b44c10b0a6e4102d47bc0b73b3e65250359787a045","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}